{"id":"n61456-2-7","stage":5,"title":"무더기 · 堆","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61456-2-7-1","ko":"너희 집에는 책이 정말 많다.","zh":"你们家书真多啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"집에는","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에는","audio":"/audio/9f31802eb4117b4ea7e7.mp3"}},{"text":"책이","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책이","audio":"/audio/3898f40e123c46cffc91.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"많다.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b1283d7a31d16239461a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61456-2-7-2","ko":"응, 책장이 부족해서 방마다 여러 무더기를 쌓아 놓고 있어.","zh":"是啊，因为书架不够用，所以每个房间里都堆了好几堆书。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"책장이","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책장이","audio":"/audio/ad640f480948c510a753.mp3"}},{"text":"부족해서","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족해서","audio":"/audio/3c5164642e5d40f5f97b.mp3"}},{"text":"방마다","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방마다","audio":"/audio/68d6438c422771b1e113.mp3"}},{"text":"여러","meaning":"多个，许多，多种","explanation":"여러：多个，许多，多种。","readings":[{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17300","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}},{"text":"무더기를","meaning":"堆","explanation":"무더기：堆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무더기","audio":"/audio/ab1a69e6561fd562b6cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61456","senseId":"2","lemma":"무더기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무더기를","audio":"/audio/8b411a5ea0e352044093.mp3"}},{"text":"쌓아","meaning":"堆，叠放","explanation":"쌓다：堆，叠放；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쌓다","audio":"/audio/a0dfc8fef79804fd89ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62095","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌓아","audio":"/audio/21b567dfbf87b42371e5.mp3"}},{"text":"놓고","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓고","audio":"/audio/4d87d21ee2c596006dc8.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书柜","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78697","definition":"存放书籍的柜子。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"3dd9c5f65c6da41a","term":"부족하다","zh":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3","entryId":"59849","definition":"未能达到需要的数量或基准，不充裕。","pronunciation":["부조카다"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"9132eb626207a0b0","term":"여러","zh":"多个，许多，多种","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3","entryId":"17300","definition":"很多数量的。","pronunciation":["여러"]},{"id":"ab1a69e6561fd562","term":"무더기","zh":"堆","audio":"/audio/ab1a69e6561fd562b6cf.mp3","entryId":"61456","definition":"量词，用于数成堆的物品的单位。","pronunciation":["무더기"]},{"id":"a0dfc8fef79804fd","term":"쌓다","zh":"堆，叠放","audio":"/audio/a0dfc8fef79804fd89ca.mp3","entryId":"62095","definition":"将多个东西层层撂起。","pronunciation":["싸타"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4756ad5e64117f45be37.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.393,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61456","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，因为书架不够用，所以每个房间里都堆了好几堆书。","你们家书真多啊。","奶奶，我们去市场吃好吃的吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你们家书真多啊。","奶奶，我们去市场吃好吃的吧。","是啊，因为书架不够用，所以每个房间里都堆了好几堆书。"],"answer":2}]}
